# Live demo on the box (phase 5, step 5.6): the environment of both Live tasks, read with node --env-file.
# Copy to C:\HomosServe\live.env (written by cywil, read-only for homos-web). Names only here; the values below are
# the box paths agreed in deploy/live/README.md. Never put a key, a wallet address or a token in this file:
# bot/live.ts refuses to start when the environment holds one.

# The demo mode (the observer runs only its wallet-free loops; also silences the watch-address warning).
BOT_MODE=live
# State of the observer, the paper ledger, the rankings and the nightly steps; homos-web may write here only.
BOT_STATE_DIR=C:\HomosServe\live\state
# The five walk-forward files of the research period (read-only), see the copy list in the README.
BOT_RESULTS_DIR=C:\HomosServe\live\results
# The read-only bot API, on 127.0.0.1 only; the chat server forwards /live/api/* to it.
BOT_API_PORT=8788
# Per-host call counting to <state>/net-stats.json; keep it on for the first days of the measurement.
LIVE_COUNT_CALLS=1
# Optional, empty = the public RPC lists in bot/config.ts. A paid RPC URL would go here (owner's decision only).
# RPC_MAINNET=
# RPC_BASE=
# RPC_ARBITRUM=
